    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d548">

                <pb facs="1006" n="944" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg944"/>

                <head>No. 543.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Baker to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-10-24"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 24, 1878</date>.
                        (Received November 18.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 57.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I send herewith a decree of the President
                    of Venezuela, convoking a convention, to meet in Caracas, on the 10th of
                    December next, for the purpose of changing the present constitution of the
                    republic—that of 1874—and looking to the revival of the constitution of 1864,
                    together with an accompanying address of the same functionary, as the same
                    appear in the Gaceta Oficial of the 16th of September last past, as also a
                    translation of these documents.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp; c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JEHU BAKER.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d548-a1.xml" xpointer="d548-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
